sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Customer

    participant App as Customer App
    participant API
    participant OrderService
    participant VendorService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Notification

    Customer->>App: Request Order Change

    App->>API: PATCH /orders/{id}

    API->>OrderService: Validate Change Request

    OrderService->>DB: Load Order

    DB-->>OrderService: Current Order

    alt Order Can Be Modified

        OrderService->>VendorService: Request Approval

        VendorService->>Notification: Notify Vendor

        Notification-->>VendorService: Delivered

        VendorService-->>OrderService: Approved

        OrderService->>DB: Update Order

        DB-->>OrderService: Updated

        OrderService->>Notification: Notify Customer

        Notification-->>App: Order Updated

        API-->>App: 200 OK

    else Modification Not Allowed

        API-->>App: 409 Conflict

    end